<section begin=intro />'''Smite Infusion''' is a [[Warframe Augment Mod]] for {{WF|Oberon}} that allows {{A|Smite}} to be held on cast, creating a wave of energy traveling outward from the user that temporarily grants the caster and nearby allies additional {{D|Radiation}} damage to all attacks.<section end=intro />

