==Acquisition==
*This mod can be acquired by attaining the rank of '''General''' under {{Faction|Steel Meridian}}, or the rank of '''Flawless''' under {{Faction|New Loka}}, and spending {{sc|25,000}} to purchase.

==Notes==
*Damage bonus is affected by [[Ability Strength]].
*Duration is affected by [[Ability Duration]].
*Range is affected by [[Ability Range]].
*Add {{D|Radiation}} damage to weapons, additive to IPS and elemental mods.
**Does not increase the damage of most abilities, including [[Exalted Weapon|Exalted Weapons]].
**Does not merge with {{D|Heat}} or {{D|Electricity}}
***For example, with a weapon with base damage of 100 {{D|Impact}} per bullet, the mod [[Hellfire]] at max rank, and the buff from Smite Infusion at max rank with 110 strength, the damage will be: 100 {{D|Impact}}, 90 {{D|Heat}}, and 110 {{D|Radiation}}.
***In this situation, if a status proc, it will have 100/300 chance to be {{D|Impact}}, 90/300 chance to be {{D|Heat}}, and 110/300 to be {{D|Radiation}}.
*For more information on how this augment works, see [[Buff & Debuff#Elemental damage bonus|Buff &amp; Debuff]] page.
*Multiple Smite Infusions do not stack; the buff with the highest Ability Strength will take effect.
**However if a weaker instance with more Ability Duration is cast, it will take effect after the stronger buff expires.

